OL,3,GNEWSABespoke guitar to be raffled for
OL,4,ARothbury funds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "one of a kind" guitar is being
OL,7,Fraffled to help raise funds for
OL,8,Fconservation groups attempting to buy
OL,9,Fthe Rothbury Estate in Northumberland.
OL,11,FCurvy Sounds, in Heaton have customised
OL,12,Fa Tokai, Les Paul guitar which has
OL,13,Falready attracted interest from
OL,14,Fmusicians from across the North East.
OL,16,FJess Mills, co-owner of the guitar shop
OL,17,Fsaid: "Rothbury is a special place for
OL,18,Fus, it's such an important cause to
OL,19,Frestore that area and this is just our
OL,20,Flittle way of helping."
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
